  "goodToKnow": "Die Komposition is a composition, in music (eine Komposition von Bach), art (die Komposition eines Gemäldes), and even perfume or food: eine Komposition aus Aromen. Komponieren means to compose, and der Komponist (a weak noun: den Komponisten) is the composer; Germany produced many, from Bach and Beethoven to Brahms and Wagner. In linguistics, a German compound word like Haustür is ein Kompositum. Plural: die Kompositionen."
